*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  General
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Codesys (PLC/)
#  Note: PLC/.gitignore already whitelists only
#  *.project and *.csv — this covers root-level
#  Codesys artefacts if the project is ever
#  opened from the repo root.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.compileinfo
*.crc
*.lck
_CompileInfo.xml
CompileResult/
.cache/
*.compiled-library

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Winlog Pro (SCADA/)
#  The project is stored as SCADA.zip (keep).
#  If the zip is ever extracted locally, ignore
#  the runtime-generated files it produces.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
SCADA/*/DataLogs/
SCADA/*/Historical*/
SCADA/*/*.lck
SCADA/*/Backup/
SCADA/*/Temp/
SCADA/*/Reports/*.pdf
SCADA/*/Reports/*.csv

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ShopFloor (Java)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.class
bin/
out/
build/
ShopFloor/teste1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Placeholder / scratch files
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
temp.txt
